{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972580/extras/7488af274b68d189fae2fa8d67a8a6c8.avif?t=1761424203\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flappy Witch</strong> is a short but enchanting adventure about a witch and her beloved cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When her cat is taken away by humans, the witch jumps on her broom and begins a journey to bring it back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as the path unfolds, she must walk a fine line between the power of love\u2026 and the temptation of dark magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face dangerous foes, dodge mystical obstacles, and test your reflexes in a world filled with both wonder and shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the witch\u2019s heart remain pure, or will darkness consume her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972580/extras/c4e46e41774b7bf7604a459ad75df4d5.poster.avif?t=1761424203\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972580/extras/c4e46e41774b7bf7604a459ad75df4d5.webm?t=1761424203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972580/extras/c4e46e41774b7bf7604a459ad75df4d5.mp4?t=1761424203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Simple yet challenging gameplay inspired by classic arcade mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Atmospheric pixel art crafted with a magical touch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A short but emotional story about love, courage, and sacrifice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Perfect for players who enjoy fast-paced, 